<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1c1917; line-height: 1.6; background: #f5f5f4; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
    .card { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e7e5e4; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    .header { border-bottom: 2px solid #b91c1c; padding-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; text-align: center; }
    .title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #0c0a09; margin: 0 0 4px 0; }
    .status-box { background: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #fde68a; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 24px 0; text-align: center; }
    .footer { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #f5f5f4; font-size: 12px; color: #a8a29e; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="header">
      <h1 class="title">Muchea Stockfeed &amp; Hardware</h1>
      <p style="color: #78716c; font-size: 13px; margin: 0;">For Farms, Homes &amp; Lifestyles • Muchea, WA</p>
    </div>

    <p>G'day <%= @customer.first_name %>,</p>

    <p>
      Thank you for registering your details with <strong>Muchea Stockfeed &amp; Hardware</strong>.
      We have received your profile and account request.
    </p>

    <div class="status-box">
      <strong style="color: #92400e; font-size: 15px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;">
        ⏳ Status: Profile Pending Approval
      </strong>
      <span style="font-size: 13px; color: #78350f;">
        To ensure genuine pastoral and wholesale pricing integrity, all member accounts are personally reviewed by our shed management before prices and ordering are unlocked.
      </span>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #44403c;">
      Our team typically reviews applications within standard shed trading hours (Monday – Friday 7:30am – 5:00pm, Saturday 8:00am – 4:00pm). You will receive an email confirmation as soon as your profile is activated.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #44403c;">
      Need an urgent quote for feed delivery or truck slings right now? Call our Muchea counter directly on <strong>(08) 9571 8840</strong>.
    </p>

    <div class="footer">
      Muchea Stockfeed &amp; Hardware Pty Ltd • 14 Great Northern Highway, Muchea WA 6501<br>
      ABN 48 619 284 921
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
